                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As a leader in the effort on H.R. 2240, the Improving Law Enforcement Officer Safety and Wellness Through Data Act, because I firmly believe in protecting our law enforcement officers who put their lives on the line every day to keep our communities safe. The rise in anti-police rhetoric and violence against officers is deeply concerning. This bill is crucial in addressing these threats by enhancing data collection on attacks against police, allowing us to better understand the challenges they face and develop strategies to improve their safety and wellness.",
